---
// Interactive stand-in for the Currawong dial. The torque maths is ported
// from the ESP32 firmware (firmware/currawong_knob/src/feel.h and haptics()
// in main.cpp): the same detent hills, walls, end-stop taper, coasting,
// landmarks and magnet, with the same constants. The motor and the hand are
// simulated; a click plays (and phones that support it buzz) on each detent.
//
// The dial drawing is the real part: crease edges of "Dial v2-1.STL" from
// src/assets/models/currawong, seen from the front, in mm about its centre
// (the 24 grip slots, the chamfer and the two counterbored screws).
// The front case's opening is the same 21 mm radius, drawn as the ring.
const DIAL_EDGES =
  "M18.72 -3.22L20.7 -3.46 12.76 -2.51 13 -0.52 20.94 -1.47 20.83 -2.64 20.98 0.74 20.77 3.11 18.8 2.72 18.98 0.67 18.95 -1.23 13 -0.52M18.72 -3.22L12.76 -2.51M18.72 -3.22L18.21 -5.37 17.64 -7.03 12.19 -4.51 19.45 -7.87 18.91 -9.09 18.61 -9.69 11.35 -6.33 16.8 -8.85 15.56 -10.86 14.59 -12.14 16.06 -13.5 10.19 -8.06 8.83 -9.53 14.7 -14.96 12.5 -16.84 15.05 -14.62 17.2 -12.01 16.06 -13.5 15.05 -14.62 14.7 -14.96 13.23 -13.6 8.83 -9.53M-13.64 -13.21L-13.79 -13.05 -15.71 -10.67 -16.08 -10.1 -10.85 -7.17 -17.83 -11.07 -16.08 -10.1M-13.64 -13.21L-9.56 -8.81 -8.09 -10.17 -13.53 -16.04 -15 -14.68 -13.64 -13.21M1.25 18.98L-1.42 18.97 -2.7 18.83 -3.09 20.8 -1.54 12.95 -2.7 18.83M1.25 18.98L1.49 20.97 1.82 20.95 5.15 20.38 8.35 19.29 11.33 17.7 14.02 15.66 13.52 16.09 12.16 14.62 8.08 10.22 13.52 16.09 11.33 17.7 9.71 18.65 6.35 11.38 4.53 12.22 7.05 17.67 4.66 18.45 3.24 18.75 3.48 20.74 5.15 20.38 7.89 19.48 4.53 12.22M1.25 18.98L0.54 13.03 1.49 20.97 -1.56 20.97 -4.9 20.45 -5.05 20.41 -3.5 12.56 -1.54 12.95M-18.81 -2.67L-18.88 -2.15 -18.98 0.91 -18.96 1.29 -13.01 0.57 -12.77 2.56 -18.73 3.27 -18.6 3.94 -17.73 6.87 -17.65 7.08 -19.46 7.92 -19.59 7.6 -20.55 4.36 -20.71 3.51 -12.77 2.56M-18.81 -2.67L-20.78 -3.06 -20.87 -2.37 -20.98 1 -20.55 4.36M-18.81 -2.67L-12.93 -1.51 -12.54 -3.47 -18.43 -4.63 -20.39 -5.02 -20.78 -3.06 -12.93 -1.51M12.16 14.62L10.25 16.02 8.87 16.83 6.35 11.38M11.81 5.48L17.05 8.4 17.8 6.65 18.41 4.69 20.38 5.07 19.68 7.35 18.8 9.38 18.25 10.41 17.82 11.13 16.07 10.15 14.79 11.95 13.62 13.26 14.99 14.73 16.34 13.21 17.82 11.13 10.84 7.23 16.07 10.15M11.81 5.48L18.8 9.38 17.05 8.4M11.81 5.48L10.84 7.23M-17.06 -8.35L-11.82 -5.43 -18.81 -9.33 -19.03 -8.86 -17.36 -11.79 -17.83 -11.07 -18.81 -9.33 -17.06 -8.35 -17.22 -8.01 -18.29 -5.15 -18.43 -4.63M-11.82 -5.43L-10.85 -7.17M3.24 18.75L2.53 12.79 3.48 20.74 1.82 20.95 -1.56 20.97 -3.09 20.8 -4.9 20.45 -8.12 19.4 -5.05 20.41 -4.67 18.45 -7.34 17.55 -8.38 17.08 -5.46 11.84 -9.36 18.83 -11.11 17.85 -10.13 16.1 -7.21